      "text": "连续批处理把不同请求的 decode 步骤合并到同一次前向。吞吐与延迟是两条互相拉扯的曲线。",
      "max_prompt_tokens": 64,
      "n_prompt": 44
    },
    {
      "prompt_id": "short-005",
      "tier": "short",
      "text": "Every measurement row carries run_id and concurrency for audit.",
